Subject: [PATCH 2/2] door: stand latch - while near the handle with the door
 still closed, zero the walking command so HOMIE stays on the standing policy
 (same function as the real robot; enter 0.3 m, leave at 10 deg or 0.5 m,
 never again once the door has opened) (10-29)

